# Local tooling state: machine-specific settings, and the nested git
# worktrees agent runs are checked out into. Both are working copies of
# other things rather than sources of this one, so neither belongs in the
# tree -- and a worktree left untracked here is a full second copy of
# `app/`, which is why tests/test_phase1a2_gates.py skips this path too.
.claude/

.env
.env.local
